  ANTIFA: In deep blue states like Washington the police routinely work WITH
  far-left activists. In this case the officer pretends that he's arresting a
  suspect who assaulted a canvasser, stole, and destroyed the signatures of
  local voters. We're seeing the same behavior from police in Portland and
  Chicago. If law abiding citizens can't count on the police to enforce the law,
  but instead enable criminal activity from the left we've got a huge problem.
  Brandi Kruse
  @BrandiKruse • 4h
  EXCLUSIVE: A @Walmart employee in Covington, WA, stole and
  destroyed voter signatures. When deputies responded, they told the
  suspect they were going to put him in handcuffs "just for show" and
  then release him.
